    "intro_narrative": "You are a rogue hacker who has infiltrated the hidden underground server room of the elusive mega-corporation, OmniCorp. The air is cold, filled with the loud hum of cooling fans and the relentless blinking of massive server racks. Your mission is to bypass their multi-layered security network and extract the final system override key before the automated security sweep locks you inside forever. The room is scattered with various cryptographic modules, standalone validators, and encrypted data drives. You must trace the data flows, activate the correct sequences, and route the right signals into the right devices. Find a way to activate the ultimate override and secure your escape.",
